$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Avicord's Planet" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Dawn" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other with their massive flying communications bases.  Each team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base to capture it for a point.  There is also a central monolith that will prove to be crucial in the battle; the team that holds this fortification gains a valuable tactical advantage over the other as well as one point.  The first team to reach 6 points shall be the victor!\n\n<f0>Map by: <f2>Nathan Sweet<f0> aka <f2>[HvC]NaTeDoGG\nFor use with the HaVoC mod version 1.5.2 or greater.\n";